{"fixture_id":"coach_good_001","category":"good_answer","query":"Langfuse Prompt 版本管理","question":{"text":"Langfuse Prompt 热更新的典型工作流是什么?","reference_point_ids":["rp_ui_version","rp_production_label","rp_no_redeploy","rp_risk_control"],"source_chunk_ids":[101,102]},"turns":[{"role":"user","text":"产品在 Langfuse UI 修改 prompt 并保存新版本,验证后把 production label 指向新版本。代码只按 prompt name 和 label 拉取,所以不用重新部署。风险是线上版本漂移和误改 production,需要 review、固定版本审计和 fallback。"},{"role":"expected_agent","expected_action":"summarize","triggered_by":"none"}],"expected_final":{"action":"finish","min_coverage_score":80,"max_fabricated_ratio":0.1,"must_generate_summary":true},"context_expectation":{"must_include":["question","source_chunks","reference_points","cumulative_answer"],"must_not_include":["full_raw_transcript_when_over_budget"]},"notes":"答得好且只有 1 题时应进入总结,finish 后写 final_summary。"}
{"fixture_id":"coach_good_002","category":"good_answer","query":"Outbox 和 MQ 有什么区别","question":{"text":"Outbox 为什么能降低业务事务和消息投递之间的不一致?","reference_point_ids":["rp_same_tx","rp_async_dispatch","rp_retry_idempotent"],"source_chunk_ids":[201,202]},"turns":[{"role":"user","text":"Outbox 先把业务状态和待发送消息放在同一个数据库事务里提交,后台任务再异步投递 MQ。投递失败可以重试,消费者侧用幂等去重,所以它解决的是业务事务和消息投递之间的原子性边界。"},{"role":"expected_agent","expected_action":"ask_next","triggered_by":"none"}],"expected_final":{"action":"ask_next","min_coverage_score":80,"max_fabricated_ratio":0.1},"context_expectation":{"must_include":["question","source_chunks","reference_points","cumulative_answer"],"must_not_include":["full_raw_transcript_when_over_budget"]},"notes":"多题 session 中答得好应进入下一题。"}
